        "text": "**Initiating File Creation**\n\nI'm now starting the \"same-scenario\" file generation. My current focus is on `describe_image.py`, leveraging `vision_client.py`, `vision_models.py`, and the Azure Image Analysis SDK. I intend to generate a file that allows me to use the Azure Image Analysis SDK.\n\n\n",
