        "text": "**Analyzing the Image Script**\n\nI'm now diving into the `detect_image_text.py` script. The goal is to figure out exactly how it handles image text detection. I'm focusing on the logic and any dependencies it relies on. I'm hoping to get a good understanding of its overall architecture.\n\n\n",
